Measure 39 is troublesome due to the crushed note at the beginning,
which does not seem to sound quite right regardless of which timing I
choose, and some guitarists appear to skip these notes completely.  I
have prepared four different versions here to make it easier to test
different timings.  The version can be selected by setting
acciaccatura_version below to a value from 1 to 4.

define(`acciaccatura_version', `4')
